bind Detect Fraudulent Activity: Transaction Type, Transaction Amount, Fraud Risk Level
bind Verify Customer Identity: Verification Attempts, Verification Status
bind Review Transaction Details: Transaction Type, Transaction Amount
bind Approve Transaction: Transaction Type, Transaction Amount
bind Decline Transaction: Transaction Type, Transaction Amount
bind Report Suspicious Activity: Transaction Type, Transaction Amount
bind Update Account Security: Days Since Last Activity
bind Notify Customer: Customer Notification Method
bind Investigate Security Breach: Breach Severity
bind Implement Security Patch: Security Patch Status
Transaction Type: Purchase, Transfer, Withdrawal, Deposit
Transaction Amount: float between 0.01 and 999999.99
Fraud Risk Level: Low, Medium, High
Verification Attempts: integer between 0 and 10
Verification Status: Pending, Verified, Failed
Days Since Last Activity: integer between 0 and 365
Customer Notification Method: SMS, Email, Phone Call, Push Notification
Breach Severity: integer between 1 and 10
Security Patch Status: Applied, Not Applied, In Progress, Failed
Absence6[Detect Fraudulent Activity] | |
Precedence[Approve Transaction, Verify Customer Identity] | | |
Response[Detect Fraudulent Activity, Notify Customer] | | |
Response[Decline Transaction, Report Suspicious Activity] | | |
Response[Review Transaction Details, Verify Customer Identity] |A.Transaction Amount > 1000 | |0,10,m
Response[Detect Fraudulent Activity, Decline Transaction] |A.Fraud Risk Level is High | |0,5,m
Response[Notify Customer, Update Account Security] |A.Customer Notification Method is SMS | |0,24,h
Response[Investigate Security Breach, Implement Security Patch] |A.Breach Severity > 7 | |0,48,h
Response[Investigate Security Breach, Implement Security Patch] | | |0,72,h
